      "reason": "Chrome fetches /favicon.ico after the load, a page request in its Network events (reqid 4); Crane fetches no icon yet. All three browsers fetch one, so Crane will (golden rule 2): queue item icon1 (main, 2:44 PM ET 2026-11-23: link rel=icon processing plus the default /favicon.ico at Chrome's point after load)."
    },
    {
      "case": "network: list, filter, details",
      "call": 4,
      "reason": "Chrome fetches /favicon.ico after the load, a page request in its Network events (reqid 4); Crane fetches no icon yet. All three browsers fetch one, so Crane will (golden rule 2): queue item icon1 (main, 2:44 PM ET 2026-11-23: link rel=icon processing plus the default /favicon.ico at Chrome's point after load). The count differs with it."
    },
    {
      "case": "network: list, filter, details",
      "call": 5,
      "reason": "Request headers: Chrome sends its UA client hints (sec-ch-ua*, Chromium only) and its own user-agent; Crane's user-agent is Crane/0.1 (ruling 2026-11-21); the order of requestWillBeSent's headers is Blink's hash order. The response headers' order is a CDP finding (Chrome's Headers are a sorted dictionary) for Crane's Network domain."
    },
    {
      "case": "network: list, filter, details",
      "call": 9,
      "reason": "Chrome fetches /favicon.ico after the load, a page request in its Network events (reqid 4); Crane fetches no icon yet. All three browsers fetch one, so Crane will (golden rule 2): queue item icon1 (main, 2:44 PM ET 2026-11-23: link rel=icon processing plus the default /favicon.ico at Chrome's point after load). The later reqids shift by it."
    },
    {
      "case": "network: list, filter, details",
      "call": 1,
      "reason": "The page sets document.title after its load (from a fetch); Chrome reports every title the page sets (WebContents TitleWasSet -> Target info), Crane's BrowserSide reports the title only at DOMContentLoaded and load (browser_side.zig fanOutNavigation), so Target.getTargets still has the load-time title. A CDP finding for main (a title-change hook from the DOM, Blink's Document::UpdateTitle)."
    }
